    { type: "short", q: "In which year did the Ottoman Turks control Egypt?", answer: "1516", difficulty: 2, explanation: "In 1516 the Ottoman Turks controlled Egypt, ending about 260 years of actual Mamluk rule." },
    { type: "concept", q: "Explain why the rivalry between the Portuguese and the Ottoman Turks mattered for Egypt.", answer: "control of the red sea and indian ocean trade|motivated the ottomans to control egypt", difficulty: 3, explanation: "Rivalry over control of the Red Sea and the Indian Ocean was the main reason the Ottomans took Egypt." }
